            <div xml:id="d13-a4">

                <pb facs="0746" n="596" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg596"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 4.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Decree No. 520</hi>.</head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">immigration law.</hi></p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Chapter I</hi>.—<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Article II.</hi></p>
                <p>Subjects of the Celestial Empire shall not be contracted as immigrants or
                    accepted as such, neither those from other countries older than sixty, unless
                    they be parents of a family coming with them or already established here, nor
                    criminals already convicted in their respective countries, nor those lacking the
                    health and morals required.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-05-25"><hi rendition="#italic">May 25,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
